v0.2.14 - fetch remote via ctx.inject, top inject stays minimal

ctx.inject creates a sub-plugin with its own inject list, so a missing service
stalls only that child instead of the whole package. remote.settings and
remote are now requested together there (two-step property evaluation needs
both names); top-level inject is back to ['slots','locale'].

Also fixed verify-activation.mjs, which wrongly treated those services as
unavailable and produced a false alarm. 311 tests.
